      "timestamp_minutes": 80.0,
      "type": "consult",
      "args": {},
      "justification": "Burn center referral criteria have been assessed; now formal consultation with the burn center should be initiated per ABA guidelines for appropriate burns (major burns, inhalation injury, special areas, etc.)."
    },
    {
