      "timestamp_minutes": 85.0,
      "type": "order_imaging",
      "args": {
        "imaging_type": "ct"
      },
      "justification": "Inhalation injury signs were assessed; if there is clinical suspicion for inhalation injury (history of enclosed space fire, carbonaceous sputum, stridor), fiberoptic bronchoscopy is the gold standard for confirming subglottic inhalation injury per burn guidelines."
    },
    {
