      "timestamp_minutes": 90.0,
      "type": "order_lab",
      "args": {
        "test_code": "unknown"
      },
      "justification": "Burn patients are at risk for progressive airway edema, especially with suspected inhalation injury. Continuous monitoring of airway patency is critical even after initial airway assessment."
    },
    {
